	<!-- ============================================================
	     Modernized spell bar (Slate Glass HUD look)
	     - each gem is a framed tile: gold rim, dark ring with rounded inner corners, then the
	       icon (32px, inset 2px)
	     - gem pieces, as the game uses them: Holder sits behind the icon (backing plate),
	       Highlight is drawn on top of every gem all the time (the frame, clear centre),
	       Background is laid over the icon while it's unavailable/casting (kept fully clear)
	     - flat spellbook button: steel book outline, gold on hover and while the book is open
	     - even 3px padding around the gems (they used to touch the top and bottom edges)
	     Art: csw_pieces.png (EQUI_Animations.xml), button template BDT_CSPW_Book (EQUI_Templates.xml)
	     ============================================================ -->
